bound 10: a 12-character string  = "123456789012"
bound 10: the next insertion  = EXN Lm_rformat.RFormatOverflow
width 10: aaaa bbbbbbbb c, plain then bbbbbbbb in an atomic zone  = "aaaa\nbbbbbbbb\nc" / "aaaa bbbbbbbb c"
hzone with hspace  = "x\ny"
format_depth: empty; after szone, pushm, hzone; after format_flush; after format_flush_popm  = 1 4 3 2
